  "body": "Discover effortless modern living in this spacious, brand new freestanding home, ideally positioned in a popular East Auckland location. Designed for comfort, style and easy living, it's ready for you to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you're welcomed by a layout that's been thoughtfully considered for everyday family life. Separate living and separate dining areas gives everyone room to spread out, whether it's movie night, homework at the table, or hosting friends for dinner. The dining area flows straight out to a deck area, perfect for entertaining, weekend barbecues, or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms provide comfortable, private space for the entire family. Outside, the fully fenced section adds peace of mind for the children and pets, rounding out a home that works as hard as you do, without adding extra upkeep to your week\r\n\r\nThen there's the location and it genuinely delivers. You're zoned for some of East Auckland's most sought-after schools, including Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College. Local shops, supermarkets, cafes and everyday amenities are all close by, with parks, beaches and recreational facilities just a short drive away, plus easy access to main transport routes and public transport options.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand new, stand-alone home in a desirable East Auckland location, offering space, style and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vish today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nFind more properties you may like at: www.teamvish.co.nz",
